  "description": "A .NET client library for the Overkiz cloud and local REST API, enabling control and monitoring of Somfy, Atlantic Cozytouch, Hitachi Hi Kumo, and other Overkiz-compatible smart-home gateways and devices. Supports both cloud (OAuth2/cookie) and local (bearer token) connection modes, device discovery, state polling, command execution, and real-time event streaming.",
